  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Remote Service Gateway connects this Lens to hosted AI services: Snap3D, OpenAI, Gemini, Imagen and Lyria.
    
    The Lens needs a Remote Service Gateway token. Without one, every example answers with an error instead of a result.
    
    Use Previous / Next to pick an example: it runs by itself, and the log above it shows each call. Leaving an example stops it.
